  {
    "id": 2007004040030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うん……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサー……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "っ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "なんで！？　今日直帰じゃなかったの！？\r\nえっ、もしかしてもう朝！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "嘘っ、ごめんなさいっ！\r\n時間やばかったりとか──",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああいや、そんなに焦らなくて大丈夫だぞ\r\n遅いけど、まだ今日だ。朝じゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そっ……か、良かったぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサー、夜は来ないって聞いてたから\r\nもう朝なのかと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ごめん、勘違いさせたな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いや、もとはと言えば三峰が悪いから！\r\nごめんなさい、勝手に事務所に一泊しそうになっちゃって",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "呼び間違いもそうだし、\r\nＰたんには変なとこ見られてばっかだなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "隠れてお勉強～なんて一番バレちゃダメなやつじゃんね、\r\n恥ずかしいったら……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華、それは……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "恥ずかしがる\r\nことじゃない",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "俺こそ、\r\n気付かせて悪かった",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "俺は何も見てないし\r\n聞いてない！",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうあれ、結華が一生懸命なことに変わりはないんだ\r\n隠す必要も、恥ずかしがる必要もないと思うぞ",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まーたＰたんはそうやって真っ正面から褒める～",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そりゃあ褒めるべきことをやってるんだから褒めるだろう\r\n──今日も遅くまでお疲れ様、結華",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "えー……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えー……って。不満か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まぁ……不満と言うか、なんと言うか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だってさ、今の三峰、割と格好つかなくない？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "んー……俺はそうは思わないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、仮に格好がついてないとしても、別にいいだろ\r\n本番で格好つけられてれば十分だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだ練習中、研究中の時まで完璧でいようとしたら\r\n大変になっちゃうからな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "っ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふーん……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーがそう言ってくれるんなら、\r\nまぁいっか……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040190"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040200,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やだなぁさっきからー\r\nＰたんが謝ること、何もないでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、今起きたら結華は気にするだろうなーって\r\nわかってたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからこう、もっとスマートにブランケットだけ掛けて\r\n退散できてれば良かったんだけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサー、そんなこと思ってたの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？　ああ。結華は、こういうところを見られるの\r\n好きじゃないんじゃないかと思って……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あーららぁ……\r\n見破られちゃってるとか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もうちょっと上手く気配でも消せていれば──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いいよいいよプロデューサー、\r\nそんな忍者みたいなスキルゲットしようとしなくても",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……別にプロデューサーにだったら、\r\n見つけてもらうのも悪くないかなって感じしてるしね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうそう！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──こんなこと滅多に言わないんだから、\r\n特別だって自覚は持ってほしいところだけど",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040270,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ん！　なんでもなーい",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040270"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040280,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "え",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700404/2007004040280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから大丈夫だ！\r\n結華がきまり悪く思う必要は全然ないぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004040290,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……っふ、あはは！\r\nそれは無理があるでしょプロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
